---
description: Restart the dev server yourself only when you started it or positively identified it — ask first otherwise.
alwaysApply: true
---

After a server-code change, restart the dev process yourself — but ONLY when it is
(a) a process you started in this session, or (b) a listener you positively identified
as this repo's dev process by inspecting its command line.

- Any other listener — an unidentified process on `:8787`, and ALWAYS the hermetic e2e
  server on `:8791` — ask the user first; never restart or kill it yourself.
- Dev runs as a single process on `:8787`; there is no separate `:5173` frontend dev
  server to manage.
- Reference the repo's dev script — see the `dev` scripts in `server/package.json` and
  the root `package.json` — rather than reconstructing or duplicating a command line here.
